      <slug></slug>
      <title>Web Applications in GNOME</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk we&amp;#39;ll see how web applications are being integrated into the&#xA;new GNOME 3 experience. We&amp;#39;ll cover both the current status of the&#xA;specifications and its support in GNOME 3.2 through the Epiphany&#xA;application mode and the new developments in the multiple emerging&#xA;standards (Mozilla OpenWebApps, Chrome applications, WAC applications, W3C&#xA;widgets, etc) and how we plan to support them in future versions of GNOME.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="4071">Xan López</person>
      </persons>
